00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:39,750
So here they're going on the journey of the presidency.

86
00:06:40,130 --> 00:06:40,290
Right.

87
00:06:40,790 --> 00:06:42,130
So I wish you Godspeed.

88
00:06:42,590 --> 00:06:43,110
Godspeed.

89
00:06:43,850 --> 00:06:44,630
Very good.

90
00:06:44,950 --> 00:06:47,210
And now let's take a look at our last set of words.

